From: Ben Bangert <100193+bbangert@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rk915: include linux/hex.h for mac_pton()

Linux 7.1 declares mac_pton() in linux/hex.h, which nothing else pulls
in here.

---
--- a/src/umac_if.c
+++ b/src/umac_if.c
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 #include <linux/interrupt.h>
 #include <linux/of_net.h>
 #include <linux/ip.h>
+#include <linux/hex.h>
 #include <linux/kernel.h>
 #include <linux/moduleparam.h>
 #include <linux/udp.h>
